{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_1","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"東京道","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_2","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"東京遼陽府，本朝鮮之地。周武王釋箕子囚，去之朝鮮，因以封之。作八條之教，尚禮義，富農桑，外戶不閉，人不為盜。傳四十餘世。燕屬真番、朝鮮，始置吏、築障。秦屬遼東外徼。漢初，燕人滿王故空地。武帝元封三年，定朝鮮為真番、臨屯、樂浪、玄菟四郡。後漢出入青、幽二州，遼東、玄菟二郡，沿革不常。漢末為公孫度所據，傳子康；孫淵，自稱燕王，建元紹漢，魏滅之。晉陷高麗，後歸慕容垂；子寶，以勾麗王安為平州牧居之。元魏太武遣使至其所居平壤城，遼東京本此。唐高宗平高麗，於此置安東都護府；後為渤海大氏所有。大氏始保挹婁之東牟山。武后萬歲通天中，為契丹盡忠所逼，有乞乞仲象者，度遼水自固，武后封為震國公。傳子祚榮，建都邑，自稱震王，併吞海北，地方五千里，兵數十萬。中宗賜所都曰忽汗州，封渤海郡王。十有二世至彝震，僭號改元，擬建宮闕，有五京、十五府、六十二州，為遼東盛國。忽汗州即故平壤城也，號中京顯德府。太祖建國，攻渤海，拔忽汗城，俘其王大諲譔，以為東丹王國，立太子圖欲為人皇王以主之。神冊四年，葺遼陽故城，以渤海、漢戶建東平郡，為防禦州。天顯三年，遷東丹國民居之，升為南京。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_3","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"城名天福，高三丈，有樓櫓，幅員三十里。八門：東曰迎陽，東南曰韶陽，南曰龍原，西南曰顯德，西曰大順，西北曰大遼，北曰懷遠，東北曰安遠。宮城在東北隅，高三丈，具敵樓，南為三門，壯以樓觀，四隅有角樓，相去各二里。宮牆北有讓國皇帝御容殿。大內建二殿，不置宮嬪，唯以內省使副、判官守之。大東丹國新建南京碑銘，在宮門之南。外城謂之漢城，分南北市，中為看樓；晨集南市，夕集北市。街西有金德寺；大悲寺；駙馬寺，鐵幡竿在焉；趙頭陀寺；留守衙；戶部司；軍巡院，歸化營軍千餘人，河、朔亡命，皆籍于此。東至北烏魯虎克四百里，南至海邊鐵山八百六十里，西至望平縣海口三百六十里，北至挹婁縣、范河二百七十里。東、西、南三面抱海。遼河出東北山口為范河，西南流為大口，入于海；東梁河自東山西流，與渾河合為小口，會遼河入于海，又名太子河，亦曰大梁水；渾河在東梁、范河之間；沙河出東南山西北流，徑蓋州入于海。有蒲河；清河；浿水，亦曰泥河，又曰蓒芋濼，水多蓒芋之草；駐蹕山，唐太宗征高麗，駐蹕其巔數日，勒石紀功焉，俗稱手山，山巔平石之上有掌指之狀，泉出其中，取之不竭。又有明王山、白石山－－亦曰橫山。天顯十三年，改南京為東京，府曰遼陽。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_4","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"戶四萬六百四。轄州、府、軍、城八十七。統縣九：","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_5","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"遼陽縣。本渤海國金德縣地。漢浿水縣，高麗改為勾麗縣，渤海為常樂縣。戶一千五百。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_6","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"仙鄉縣。本漢遼隊縣，渤海為永豐縣。神仙傳云：「仙人白仲理能煉神丹，點黃金，以救百姓。」戶一千五百。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_7","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"鶴野縣。本漢居就縣地，渤海為雞山縣。昔丁令威家此，去家千年，化鶴來歸，集於華表柱，以咮畫表云：「有鳥有鳥丁令威，去家千年今來歸；城郭雖是人民非，何不學仙塚纍纍。」戶一千二百。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_8","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"析木縣。本漢望平縣地，渤海為花山縣。戶一千。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_9","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"紫蒙縣。本漢鏤芳縣地。後拂涅國置東平府，領蒙州紫蒙縣。後徙遼城，并入黃嶺縣。渤海復為紫蒙縣。戶一千。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_10","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"興遼縣。本漢平郭縣地，渤海改為長寧縣。唐元和中，渤海王大仁秀南定新羅，北略諸部，開置郡邑，遂定今名。戶一千。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_11","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"肅慎縣。以渤海戶置。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_12","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"歸仁縣。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_13","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"順化縣。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_14","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"開州，鎮國軍，節度。本濊貊地，高麗為慶州，渤海為東京龍原府。有宮殿。都督慶、鹽、穆、賀四州事。故縣六：曰龍原、永安、烏山、壁谷、熊山、白楊，皆廢。疊石為城，周圍二十里。唐薛仁貴征高麗，與其大將溫沙門戰熊山，擒善射者於石城，即此。太祖平渤海，徙其民于大部落，城遂廢。聖宗伐高麗還，周覽城基，復加完葺。開泰三年，遷雙、韓二州千餘戶實之，號開封府開遠軍，節度；更名鎮國軍。隸東京留守，兵事屬東京統軍司。統州三、縣一。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_15","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"開遠縣。本柵城地，高麗為龍原縣，渤海因之，遼初廢。聖宗東討，復置以軍額。民戶一千。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_16","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"鹽州。本渤海龍河郡，故縣四：海陽、接海、格川、龍河，皆廢。戶三百。隸開州。相去一百四十里。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_17","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"穆州，保和軍，刺史。本渤海會農郡，故縣四：會農、水歧、順化、美縣，皆廢。戶三百。隸開州。東北至開州一百二十里。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_18","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"會農縣。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_19","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"賀州，刺史。本渤海吉理郡，故縣四：洪賀、送誠、吉理、石山，皆廢。戶三百。隸開州。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_20","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"定州，保寧軍。高麗置州，故縣一，曰定東。聖宗統和十三年升軍，遷遼西民實之。隸東京留守司。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_21","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"定東縣。高麗所置，遼徙遼西民居之。戶八百。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_22","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"保州，宣義軍，節度。高麗置州，故縣一，曰來遠。聖宗以高麗王詢擅立，問罪不服，統和末，高麗降，開泰三年取其保、定二州，於此置搉場。隸東京統軍司。統州、軍二，縣一：","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_23","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"來遠縣。初徙遼西諸縣民實之，又徙奚、漢兵七百防戍焉。戶一千。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_24","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"宣州，定遠軍，刺史。開泰三年徙漢戶置。隸保州。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_25","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"懷化軍，下，刺史。開泰三年置。隸保州。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_26","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"辰州，奉國軍，節度。本高麗蓋牟城。唐太宗會李世勣攻破蓋牟城，即此。渤海改為蓋州，又改辰州，以辰韓得名。井邑駢列，最為衝會。遼徙其民於祖州。初曰長平軍。戶二千。隸東京留守司。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_27","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"建安縣。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_28","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"盧州，玄德軍，刺史。本渤海杉盧郡，故縣五：山陽、杉盧、漢陽、白巖、霜巖，皆廢。戶三百。在京東一百三十里。兵事屬南女直湯河司。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_29","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"熊岳縣。西至海一十五里，傍海有熊岳山。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_30","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"來遠城。本熟女直地。統和中伐高麗，以燕軍驍猛，置兩指揮，建城防戍。兵事屬東京統軍司。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_31","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"鐵州，建武軍，刺史。本漢安市縣，高麗為安市城。唐太宗攻之不下，薛仁貴白衣登城，即此。渤海置州，故縣四：位城、河端、蒼山、龍珍，皆廢。戶一千。在京西南六十里。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_32","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"湯池縣。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_33","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"興州，中興軍，節度。本漢海冥縣地。渤海置州，故縣三：盛吉、蒜山、鐵山，皆廢。戶二百。在京西南三百里。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_34","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"湯州。本漢襄平縣地。渤海置州，故縣五：靈峰、常豐、白石、均谷、嘉利，皆廢。戶五百。在京西北一百里。","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_35","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"崇州，隆安軍，刺史。本漢長岑縣地。渤海置州，故縣三：崇山、溈水、綠城，皆廢。戶五百。在京東北一百五十里。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_36","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"崇信縣。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_37","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"海州，南海軍，節度。本沃沮國地。高麗為沙卑城，唐李世勣嘗攻焉。渤海號南京南海府。疊石為城，幅員九里，都督沃、晴、椒三州。故縣六：沃沮、鷲巖、龍山、濱海、昇平、靈泉，皆廢。太平中，大延琳叛，南海城堅守，經歲不下，別部酋長皆被擒，乃降。因盡徙其人於上京，置遷遼縣，移澤州民來實之。戶一千五百。統州二、縣一：","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_38","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"臨溟縣。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_39","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"耀州，刺史。本渤海椒州，故縣五，椒山，貂嶺、澌泉、尖山、巖淵，皆廢。戶七百。隸海州。東北至海州二百里。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_40","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"巖淵縣。東界新羅，故平壤城在縣西南。東北至海州一百二十里。","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_41","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"嬪州，柔遠軍，刺史。本渤海晴州，故縣五：天晴、神陽、蓮池、狼山、仙巖，皆廢。戶五百。隸海州。東南至海州一百二十里。","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_42","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"淥州，鴨淥軍，節度。本高麗故國，渤海號西京鴨淥府。城高三丈，廣輪二十里，都督神、桓、豐、正四州事。故縣三：神鹿、神化、劍門，皆廢。大延琳叛，遷餘黨於上京，置易俗縣居之。在者戶二千。隸東京留守司。統州四、縣二：","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_43","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"弘聞縣。","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_44","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"神鄉縣。","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_45","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"桓州。高麗中都城，故縣三：桓都、神鄉、淇水，皆廢。高麗王於此創立宮闕，國人謂之新國。五世孫釗，晉康帝建元初為慕容皝所敗，宮室焚蕩。戶七百。隸淥州。","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_46","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"在西南二百里。","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_47","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"豐州。渤海置盤安郡，故縣四：安豐、渤恪、隰壤、硤石，皆廢。戶三百。隸淥州。在東北二百一十里。","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_48","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"正州。本沸流王故地，國為公孫康所併。渤海置沸流郡。有沸流水。戶五百。隸淥州。在西北三百八十里。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_49","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"東那縣。本漢東耐縣地。在州西七十里。","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_50","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"慕州。本渤海安遠府地，故縣二：慕化、崇平，久廢。戶二百。隸淥州。在西北二百里。","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_51","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"顯州，奉先軍，上，節度。本渤海顯德府地。世宗置，以奉顯陵。顯陵者，東丹人皇王墓也。人皇王性好讀書，不喜射獵，購書數萬卷，置醫巫閭山絕頂，築堂曰望海。山南去海一百三十里。大同元年，世宗親護人皇王靈駕歸自汴京。以人皇王愛醫巫閭山水奇秀，因葬焉。山形掩抱六重，於其中作影殿，制度宏麗。州在山東南，遷東京三百餘戶以實之。應曆元年，穆宗葬世宗於顯陵西山，仍禁樵採。有十三山，有沙河。隸長寧、積慶二宮，兵事屬東京都部署司。統州三、縣三：","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_52","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"奉先縣。本漢無慮縣，即醫巫閭，幽州鎮山。世宗析遼東長樂縣民以為陵戶，隸長寧宮。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_53","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"山東縣。本漢望平縣。穆宗割渤海永豐縣民為陵戶，隸積慶宮。","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_54","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"歸義縣。初置顯州，渤海民自來助役，世宗嘉憫，因籍其人戶置縣，隸長寧宮。","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_55","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"嘉州，嘉平軍，下，刺史。隸顯州。","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_56","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"遼西州，阜成軍，中，刺史。本漢遼西郡地，世宗置州，隸長寧宮，屬顯州。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_57","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"長慶縣。統和八年，以諸宮提轄司人戶置。","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_58","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"康州，下，刺史。世宗遷渤海率賓府人戶置，屬顯州。初隸長寧宮，後屬積慶宮。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_59","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"率賓縣。本渤海率賓府地。","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_60","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"宗州，下，刺史。在遼東石熊山，耶律隆運以所俘漢民置。聖宗立為州，隸文忠王府。王薨，屬提轄司。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_61","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"熊山縣。本渤海縣地。","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_62","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"乾州，廣德軍，上，節度。本漢無慮縣地。聖宗統和三年置，以奉景宗乾陵。有凝神殿。隸崇德宮，兵事屬東京都部署司。統州一、縣四：","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_63","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"奉陵縣。本漢無慮縣地。括諸落帳戶，助營山陵。","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_64","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"延昌縣。析延昌宮戶置。","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_65","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"靈山縣。本渤海靈峰縣地。","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_66","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"司農縣。本渤海麓郡縣，併麓波、雲川二縣入焉。","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_67","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"海北州，廣化軍，中，刺史。世宗以所俘漢戶置。地在閭山之西，南海之北。初隸宣州，後屬乾州。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_68","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"開義縣。","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_69","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"貴德州，寧遠軍，下，節度。本漢襄平縣地，漢公孫度所據。太宗時察割以所俘漢民置。後以弒逆誅，沒入焉。聖宗建貴德軍，後更名。有陀河、大寶山。隸崇德宮，兵事屬東京都部署司。統縣二：","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_70","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"貴德縣。本漢襄平縣，渤海為崇山縣。","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_71","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"奉德縣。本渤海緣城縣地，嘗置奉德州。","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_72","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"瀋州，昭德軍，中，節度。本挹婁國地。渤海建瀋州，故縣九，皆廢。太宗置興遼軍，後更名。初隸永興宮，後屬敦睦宮，兵事隸東京都部署司。統州一、縣二：","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_73","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"樂郊縣。太祖俘薊州三河民，建三河縣，後更名。","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_74","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"靈源縣。太祖俘薊州吏民，建漁陽縣，後更名。","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_75","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"巖州，白巖軍，下，刺史。本渤海白巖城，太宗撥屬瀋州。初隸長寧宮，後屬敦睦宮。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_76","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"白巖縣。渤海置。","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_77","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"集州，懷眾軍，下，刺史。古陴離郡地，漢屬險瀆縣，高麗為霜巖縣，渤海置州。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_78","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"奉集縣。渤海置。","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_79","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"廣州，防禦，漢屬襄平縣，高麗為當山縣，渤海為鐵利郡。太祖遷渤海人居之，建鐵利州。統和八年省。開泰七年以漢戶置。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_80","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"昌義縣。","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_81","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"遼州，始平軍，下，節度。本拂涅國城，渤海為東平府。唐太宗親征高麗，李世勣拔遼城；高宗詔程振、蘇定方討高麗，至新城，大破之；皆此地也。太祖伐渤海，先破東平府，遷民實之。故東平府都督伊、蒙、陀、黑、北五州，共領縣十八，皆廢。太祖改為州，軍曰東平，太宗更為始平軍。有遼河、羊腸河、錐子河、蛇山、狼山、黑山、巾子山。隸長寧宮，兵事屬北女直兵馬司。統州一、縣二：","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_82","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"遼濱縣。","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_83","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"安定縣。","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_84","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"祺州，祐聖軍，下，刺史。本渤海蒙州地。太祖以檀州俘於此建檀州，後更名。隸弘義宮，兵事屬北女直兵馬司。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_85","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"慶雲縣。太祖俘密雲民，於此建密雲縣，後更名。","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_86","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"遂州，刺史。本渤海美州地，採訪使耶律頗德以部下漢民置。穆宗時，頗德嗣絕，沒入焉。隸延昌宮。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_87","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"山河縣。本渤海縣，併黑川、麓川二縣置。","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_88","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"通州，安遠軍，節度。本扶餘國王城，渤海號扶餘城。太祖改龍州，聖宗更今名。保寧七年，以黃龍府叛人燕頗餘黨千餘戶置，升節度。統縣四：","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_89","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"通遠縣。本渤海扶餘縣，併布多縣置。","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_90","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"安遠縣。本渤海顯義縣，併鵲川縣置。","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_91","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"歸仁縣，本渤海強帥縣，併新安縣置。","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_92","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"漁谷縣。本渤海縣。","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_93","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"韓州，東平軍，下，刺史。本稿離國舊治柳河縣。高麗置鄚頡府，都督鄚、頡二州。渤海因之。今廢。太宗置三河、榆河二州。聖宗併二州置。隸延昌宮，兵事屬北女直兵馬司。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_94","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"柳河縣。本渤海粵喜縣地，併萬安縣置。","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_95","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"雙州，保安軍，下，節度。本挹婁故地。渤海置安定郡，久廢。漚里僧王從太宗南征，以俘鎮、定二州之民建城置州。察割弒逆誅，沒入焉。故隸延昌宮，後屬崇德宮，兵事隸北女直兵馬司。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_96","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"雙城縣。本渤海安夷縣地。","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_97","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"銀州，富國軍，下，刺史。本渤海富州，太祖以銀冶更名。隸弘義宮，兵事屬北女直兵馬司。統縣三：","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_98","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"延津縣。本渤海富壽縣，境有延津故城，更名。","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_99","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"新興縣。本故越喜國地，渤海置銀冶，嘗置銀州。","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_100","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"永平縣。本渤海優富縣地，太祖以俘戶置。舊有永平寨。","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_101","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"同州，鎮安軍，下，節度。本漢襄平縣地，渤海為東平寨。太祖置州，軍曰鎮東，後更名。隸彰愍宮，兵事屬北女直兵馬司。統州一，未詳；縣二：","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_102","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"東平縣。本漢襄平縣地。產鐵，撥戶三百採鍊，隨征賦輸。","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_103","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"永昌縣。本高麗永寧縣地。","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_104","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"咸州，安東軍，下，節度。本高麗銅山縣地，渤海置銅山郡。地在漢候城縣北，渤海龍泉府南。地多山險，寇盜以為淵藪，乃招平、營等州客戶數百，建城居之。初號郝里太保城，開泰八年置州。兵事屬北女直兵馬司。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_105","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"咸平縣。唐安東都護，天寶中治營、平二州間，即此。太祖滅渤海，復置安東軍。開泰中置縣。","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_106","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"信州，彰聖軍，下，節度。本越喜故城。渤海置懷遠府，今廢。聖宗以地鄰高麗，開泰初置州，以所俘漢民實之。兵事屬黃龍府都部署司。統州三，未詳；縣二：","sentenceOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_107","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"武昌縣。本渤海懷福縣地，析平州提轄司及豹山縣一千戶隸之。","sentenceOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_108","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"定武縣。本渤海豹山縣地，析平州提轄司併乳水縣人戶置。初名定功縣。","sentenceOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_109","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"賓州，懷化軍，節度。本渤海城。統和十七年，遷兀惹戶，置刺史于鴨子、混同二水之間，後升。兵事隸黃龍府都部署司。","sentenceOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_110","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"龍州，黃龍府。本渤海扶餘府。太祖平渤海還，至此崩，有黃龍見，更名。保寧七年，軍將燕頗叛，府廢。開泰九年，遷城于東北，以宗州、檀州漢戶一千復置。統州五、縣三：","sentenceOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_111","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"黃龍縣。本渤海長平縣，併富利、佐慕、肅慎置。","sentenceOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_112","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"遷民縣。本渤海永寧縣，併豐水、扶羅置。","sentenceOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_113","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"永平縣。渤海置。","sentenceOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_114","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"益州，觀察。屬黃龍府。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_115","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"靜遠縣。","sentenceOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_116","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"安遠州，懷義軍，刺史。屬黃龍府。","sentenceOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_117","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"威州，武寧軍，刺史。屬黃龍府。","sentenceOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_118","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"清州，建寧軍，刺史。屬黃龍府。","sentenceOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_119","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"雍州，刺史。屬黃龍府。","sentenceOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_120","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"湖州，興利軍，刺史。渤海置。兵事隸東京統軍司。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_121","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"長慶縣。","sentenceOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_122","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"渤州，清化軍，刺史。渤海置。兵事隸東京統軍司。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_123","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"貢珍縣。渤海置。","sentenceOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_124","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"郢州，彰聖軍，刺史。渤海置。兵事隸北女直兵馬司。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_125","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"延慶縣。","sentenceOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_126","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"銅州，廣利軍，刺史。渤海置。兵事隸北兵馬司。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_127","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"析木縣。本漢望平縣地，渤海為花山縣。初隸東京，後來屬。","sentenceOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_128","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"涑州，刺史。渤海置。兵事隸南兵馬司。","sentenceOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_129","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"率賓府，刺史。故率賓國地。","sentenceOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_130","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"定理府，刺史。故挹婁國地。","sentenceOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_131","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"鐵利府，刺史。故鐵利國地。","sentenceOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_132","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"安定府。","sentenceOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_133","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"長嶺府。","sentenceOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_134","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"鎮海府，防禦。兵事隸南女直湯河司。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_135","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"平南縣。","sentenceOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_136","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"冀州，防禦。聖宗建，升永安軍。","sentenceOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_137","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"東州。以渤海戶置。","sentenceOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_138","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"尚州。以渤海戶置。","sentenceOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_139","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"吉州，福昌軍，刺史。","sentenceOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_140","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"麓州，下，刺史。渤海置。","sentenceOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_141","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"荊州，刺史。","sentenceOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_142","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"懿州，寧昌軍，節度。太平三年越國公主以媵臣戶置。初曰慶懿軍，更曰廣順軍，隸上京。清寧七年宣懿皇后進入，改今名。統縣二：","sentenceOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_143","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"寧昌縣。本平陽縣。","sentenceOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_144","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"順安縣。","sentenceOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_145","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"媵州，昌永軍，刺史。","sentenceOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_146","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"順化城，嚮義軍，下，刺史。開泰三年以漢戶置。兵事隸東京統軍司。","sentenceOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_147","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"寧州，觀察。統和二十九年伐高麗，以渤海降戶置。兵事隸東京統軍司。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_148","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"新安縣。","sentenceOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_149","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"衍州，安廣軍，防禦。以漢戶置。初刺史，後升軍。兵事屬東京統軍司。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_150","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"宜豐縣。","sentenceOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_151","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"連州，德昌軍，刺史。以漢戶置。兵事屬東京統軍司。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_152","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"安民縣。","sentenceOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_153","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"歸州，觀察。太祖平渤海，以降戶置，後廢。統和二十九年伐高麗，以所俘渤海戶復置。兵事屬南女直湯河司。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_154","chapterId"