u_38","textTraditional":"河州，德化軍。置軍器坊。","sentenceOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_172","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"祥州，瑞聖軍，節度。興宗以鐵驪戶置。兵事隸黃龍府都部署司。統縣一：","sentenceOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_38_173","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_38","textTraditional":"懷德縣。","sentenceOrder":173}],"overrides":{}}